{"text":"In those days, there were no screens updating travelers as to departure times, so I didn't know that my flight was two hours delayed until I reached the gate. The Hare Krishna laid my burdens down and said he'd wait with me. Would I have chosen to spend two hours in O'Hare with a Hare Krishna? No. But I lacked the courage to bolt. I decided that given the circumstances, the only thing I could do was listen. The ability to really listen to another person is an essential skill for a novelist. It's an essential skill for all human beings. And what the Hare Krishna told me was one of the most remarkable things I had ever heard in my life.","words":[{"text":"In","start":0.0,"end":0.9},{"text":"those","start":0.9,"end":1.1},{"text":"days","start":1.1,"end":1.36,"punct":","},{"text":"there","start":1.36,"end":1.62},{"text":"were","start":1.62,"end":1.8},{"text":"no","start":1.8,"end":2.1},{"text":"screens","start":2.1,"end":2.64},{"text":"updating","start":2.64,"end":3.64},{"text":"travelers","start":3.64,"end":4.36},{"text":"as","start":4.36,"end":5.04},{"text":"to","start":5.04,"end":5.24},{"text":"departure","start":5.24,"end":5.64},{"text":"times","start":5.64,"end":6.12,"punct":","},{"text":"so","start":6.12,"end":6.74},{"text":"I","start":6.74,"end":7.2},{"text":"didn't","start":7.2,"end":7.82},{"text":"know","start":7.82,"end":8.14},{"text":"that","start":8.14,"end":8.34},{"text":"my","start":8.34,"end":8.5},{"text":"flight","start":8.5,"end":8.76},{"text":"was","start":8.76,"end":8.96},{"text":"two","start":8.96,"end":9.16},{"text":"hours","start":9.16,"end":9.44},{"text":"delayed","start":9.44,"end":9.88},{"text":"until","start":9.88,"end":10.26},{"text":"I","start":10.26,"end":10.44},{"text":"reached","start":10.44,"end":10.66},{"text":"the","start":10.66,"end":10.92},{"text":"gate","start":10.92,"end":11.16,"punct":"."},{"text":"The","start":12.48,"end":12.56},{"text":"Hare","start":12.56,"end":12.8},{"text":"Krishna","start":12.8,"end":13.38},{"text":"